<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capitol American cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capitol American cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co said Monday it lowered its rating on Capitol American Financial Corp two steps to underweight from buy after Conseco Inc said it plans to buy Capitol American, which focuses on cancer and other special insurance.</p>
<p>Conseco said earlier Monday it has agreed to buy Capitol American for about $650 million in cash and Conseco stock.</p>
<p>Capitol American was at 35, up 10, and Conseco was at 44-1/4, up 2-1/4.</p>
<p>Analyst Nancy Benacci said in a report, &quot;We do not anticipate problems with the approval of this acquisition,&quot; which must be approved by regulators in Ohio and Arizona.</p>
<p>--Cleveland Newsdesk 216-579-0077</p>
</text>
